For those of you interested...

I am (finally!) holding another contest. This one will be a very concrete
contest, and I've worked out a special point system.

Here's the contest:
For anyone who has ever suggested YANI's, this is your moment to shine. I am
requesting your best and/or favorite ideas for items to add to NetHack. Who
knows, perhaps someone will see your idea and actually integrate it into the
3.5.x versions.

The points will be awarded as follows:

1 point for each *creative and reasonable* addition to already-existing items
(new rings, scrolls, potions, food items, wands)
2 points for *creative and reasonable* new armor/weapon/tool/artifact ideas
5 points for a *creative and reasonable* new item category

If there are any ideas that happen to be really funny, you get bonuses for
those, too. :-)

Just post the item(s) you wish to suggest along with a somewhat detailed
explanation for each. Try to be as thorough as possible.

The winners will be posted on a date depending largely on the results of the
contest. For now, I am pulling for at least 50 entries.

Good luck!
-Lester Majesto

